> Nice, elegant solution. Would making that {.i} into a boolean be
> better, or unnecessary? 

"mu'i" asserts a causal relationship.  Booleans do not, so they are
bad for this sort of thing.

I should have had a "da'i" in there, though.  Opps.  A future tense
tag would also be nice.  Ooops.

ko smaji .i da'i mi mu'i lo nu na go'i ba cecla fa'a do

